This repository contains software under two distinct licenses.

The Spacelab Engine, public APIs (including packages/game-api), reusable
libraries, rendering, physics, editor and shared tools are licensed under
the MIT License in LICENSE-ENGINE.txt. The MIT grant permits commercial
use, modification and redistribution of the engine and APIs, subject to
its terms. It does not grant rights to the proprietary game content below.

The following first-party paths are proprietary Space Sim game material:

